<%# The favicon and the touch icon (theming spec §2). A theme replaces this
    file and links its own, from its assets/images, with image_path. The
    touch icon's address is `SiteIconsController`'s, which answers with the
    theme's assets/images/apple-touch-icon.png when it brings one. %>
<link rel="icon" href="/icon.png" type="image/png">
<link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
